1️⃣ Production Outage due to Traffic Spike / Scaling Failure

Context

Application hosted on Kubernetes / EC2 / App Service

Normal traffic suddenly spiked (campaign, cron, bot, partner integration)

Impact

Increased latency

5xx errors

Business impact (orders failed, users dropped)

Detection

Alert fired on latency SLO

CPU looked fine but connection pool exhausted

Action

Increased replicas

Tuned HPA (CPU → custom metrics like RPS or latency)

Throttled abusive traffic

Resolution

Traffic stabilized

Errors dropped within X minutes

Learning (KEY)

“We realized CPU-based scaling was insufficient. We moved to request-rate based scaling and introduced load testing for peak events.”

